sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OP as Operator week6 script
    participant AP as openbao authz ok pod
    participant DP as openbao authz denied pod
    participant K8S as Kubernetes token reviewer API
    participant OBAO as OpenBao kubernetes auth
    participant OBPOL as OpenBao role and policy
    participant MADM as MinIO admin API
    participant MDATA as MinIO S3 data API
    OP->>AP: Start Week 6 validation
    AP->>OBAO: Login with service account JWT and role
    OBAO->>K8S: Review JWT against cluster trust
    K8S-->>OBAO: Token review valid
    OBAO->>OBPOL: Evaluate bound service account and namespace
    OBPOL-->>OBAO: Allow and attach read policy
    OBAO-->>AP: Issue leased client token with TTL
    AP->>OBAO: Read secret phase2 week6
    OBAO-->>AP: Return dynamic secret value
    DP->>OBAO: Login with unauthorized JWT
    OBAO->>OBPOL: Evaluate role binding for denied pod
    OBPOL-->>OBAO: Deny login
    OBAO-->>DP: Return auth failure
    AP->>MADM: Request temporary access key with expiry
    MADM-->>AP: Return short lived access key and secret key
    AP->>MDATA: Write and read object with temporary credentials
    MDATA-->>AP: Return object payload success
    DP->>MDATA: Attempt object operation with wrong secret
    MDATA-->>DP: Deny invalid access key signature
